{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Just Pool&quot; is a very simple and minimalistic game of pool. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click-and-drag the mouse cursor to shoot the cueball;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to score all the balls on either one of the 6 the holes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by scoring all 15 balls;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player (Multiplayer is currently in development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated pool table/ball physics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon-ish models and textures;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cell-shading.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A message from the creator of the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I would recommend buying this game on either one of two ocasions:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1- You like supporting small creators;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2- You like a straight-forward and casual style game of pool.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game was developed for my own learning experience in game development and steam publishing.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101270?t=1773353430","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101270/02ee3718cccefff680632d9f26ecc2cf26a2fdc5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773353430","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101270/a73d722f8a8fdb34ab04ff0412cb23b786f034e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773353430","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101270/a73d722f8a8fdb34ab04ff0412cb23b786f034e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773353430","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Just Pool&quot; is a very simple and minimalistic game of pool. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click-and-drag the mouse cursor to shoot the cueball;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to score all the balls on either one of the 6 the holes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by scoring all 15 balls;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player (Multiplayer is currently in development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated pool table/ball physics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon-ish models and textures;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cell-shading.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A message from the creator of the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I would recommend buying this game on either one of two ocasions:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1- You like supporting small creators;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2- You like a straight-forward and casual style game of pool.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game was developed for my own learning experience in game development and steam publishing.</i></p>","developers":["Mana Potion"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101270/e1d741f969e5ce75f3b9b46366b7f53a3f8908ef/header.jpg?t=1773353430","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or equivalent modern Linux distribut